  "scope": "The prior tests spec section 6 lists for L4a: the selector, resolve-contract, routing, operational-boundary and availability tests, the fake, the quarantined / migration_note suites (pair authority store, the five writer-floor modules, connection-only resolve, pair admin disposition / mutations / review fixes, the OAuth flow, profile reader removed, error mark inventory), the PostgreSQL backing test, the OpenRouter availability test, the offline-only Profile index test and the Anthropic bootstrap docstring. Tests that pinned quarantined, named selection, SelectorPolicy, D18 row 4 or the bootstrap warning are deleted or re-expressed for the two-state marker and the default selector; the fake witness test becomes test_the_fake_witness_agrees_with_the_real_backing; test_operational_outcome_boundaries.py gains a moved-marker dispatch case. Plus four files outside the section 6 list, approved by the owner on 2026-10-29: test_provider_access_http.py (the SelectorUnknown import and its 404 row removed), test_pair_admin_connection_only.py (a five-field PairAuthority and its comment), tests/unit/test_bootstrap.py (a comment naming the renamed absence check), and test_connection_backed_resolve_contract.py under option C1 (the two twins deleted, NOT_REIMPORTED shrunk to the fake-only witness, the docstring refreshed).",
  "reason": "OME-1138 close-out L4a (spec section 4.2): the quarantined marker state, the X-Profile compatibility path (SelectorPolicy, HONOUR, named selection, SelectorUnknown), D18 row 4, the AIGATEWAY_BOOTSTRAP_FROM_CLAUDE_CODE warning and every migration_note read and write are retired, so the tests that pinned them are deleted or re-expressed. The fake now models a stored credential as the pair's effective Connection, as the real harness seeds it. The owner approved the four files outside the section 6 list on 2026-10-29 as direct consequences of spec section 4.2 that section 6 did not list; option C1 moves the deleted twins' assertions into the resolve contract, which runs on both witnesses (the fake and the real backing).",
